Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I must say, I'm impressed you found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Finding one of your other selves\Nin the city isn't so hard for me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My, my. You sure weren't gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't kill her. I held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I take it you haven't come for a tea party?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A question, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whether I can answer or not\Ndepends on the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zaphkiel is an Angel\Nthat manipulates time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.97,0:00:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And each and every 12 of the dials\Nhas some sort of different power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of those 12, does one have a bullet\Nto send someone you shoot into the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.53,0:00:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Supposing there is one,\Nwhat would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That I want to borrow your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You suggesting that I use\NYod Bet for your sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, here's my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately, I'm afraid\NI'll have to disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You may have incredible power,\Nbut it means nothing if you can't hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so being underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just out of curiosity, what would\Nyou be doing with Yod Bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... want you to send me\Nto August 3rd, five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five years ago, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To go back five years and make my\Ndad and mom's deaths never happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With this power, I'll change history!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.25,0:01:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what will you do if I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.63,0:01:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make you agree by any means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? You've gone and said it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried about using Yod Bet\Nwithout testing it first anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll have you be my guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zaphkiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yod Bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go and show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How mad and foolish trying\Nto change the world is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and how far God permits it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:42.09,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Tengu City Municipal Hospital"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh, Shido... I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:44.89,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Tengu City Municipal Hospital"\N"Episode Eight:\N'Demon King of Descending Darkness"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.97,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Eight:\N'Demon King of Descending Darkness"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, you're not giving our kinswoman\Nthe forbidden fruit before us, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Complaint. Shido is forgetting that\Nhe's our property first and foremost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.73,0:02:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Me, too, me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah. I'll grab you\Nsomething, so hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you two want anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:14.08,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Kotori"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Yoshino. This isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's all this ruckus about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Natsumi! This isn't...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You rotten fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You did perverted things to Yoshino\Nwhile I was sleeping right beside her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just reaching... for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:49.91,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Kotori"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.71,0:03:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori?! Is that you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is... five years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Metatron, Mal'akh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five years ago in Tengu City's Nankou area...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad... Mom...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found... you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found you! I found you!\NI found you! I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? Attacking me out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was wondering who it might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that Angel... Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still have the Sephirah, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you attack me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... You reversed the flow of time\Nusing Zaphkiel, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's surprising... For her\Nto lend someone her powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kadour!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems the future me has earned\Nquite the grudge from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I can't let myself\Nbe killed here by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I too have a wish I must make true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A wish? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You kill my dad and mom\Nand dare to have a wish?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Screw you! Screw you! Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't give you time for your wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't give you time to pray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Die without doing anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.54,0:06:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Disappear, leaving nothing behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have nothing but regret\Nin your empty heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and begone from the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your dad and your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but maybe you have\Nthe wrong person?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To think you could wield Metatron so well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The birth of a powerful Spirit\Nshould be celebrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That attack of yours\NI'm delighted to witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is all so my wish comes to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye. It's about time I went on my way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:08:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...since I achieved my goal for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad... Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...my dad... and mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I swear, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someday, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.89,0:08:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So Fraxinus was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'm glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're in Ratatoskr's underground base.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You all should come, too,\Nonce your pickup arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whose phone do you think you're on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.57,0:09:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like they're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fill you in on the rest\Nonce you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold up, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is, Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your performance was superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I took one too many direct hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy crew had some talented individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... Then let's hope a good number\Nof them survived then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly, Ike...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understandably, this I didn't predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To think she would become a Spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, such a pity, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're smiling, Ike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oops, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And? Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like her reaction suddenly vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could she have Spirit wave\Nsuppression powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You think so, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she's a Spirit, she knows\Nshe'll be hunted by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course she'd hide herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That would be smart, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.93,0:10:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fact we have trouble\Nunderstanding them...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is what makes Spirits Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You never know. She might be\Nwatching over us as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.86,0:10:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, was Origami able\Nto achieve her goal in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I'm to be perfectly honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really hope Origami makes\Nher wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not like me to say at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been out in\Nthe moonlight too long?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes I happen to be\Nin this sort of mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:17.48,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Kaguya Yamai" "Tohka Yatogami"\N"Yuzuru Yamai" "Miku Izayoi"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The moon! The moon's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:30.37,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Tengu City Municipal Hospital"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.01,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Tengu City Municipal Hospital"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! What's happening out there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, what is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A Spirit! But, I don't get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This powerful, without any warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This reaction is no normal Spirit!\NIt's an Inverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to save the other people!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where'd that Spirit come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ori... gami?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi's a Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, Shido... Prepare \Nyourself emotionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:44.49,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Exam Room"\N"Internal Medicine"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter who it may be,\Na Spirit is a Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll have to capture Origami Tobiichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what happened to Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:13:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, if there's one person who can\Nbring her back, it's you, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Glad to see you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you started to whine\Nand complain about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was ready to toss you through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pledge. Kaguya and I will steer\Nyou towards Master Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, please go and open up her eyes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me, Darling! I'll be\Nsad if you forget about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,L-Let us take care of\Neverything on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Zadkiel's power,\NI think I can hold her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:14:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph. I might as well help out, too, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All this debris means nothing if\NI turn it into fluffy cotton puffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll open up the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Praise. You're pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go when I draw out her attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't last long!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya, Yuzuru! C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Acknowledged. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think not. We'll have no\Nmeddling with the Inverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rescue! Raphael, El Nahash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while, Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I could've done without seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's comparable to even Princess that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a magnificent Inverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ike will be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Screw you! We won't let you take Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Barking at me like some dog\Nisn't going to accomplish anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be silent and--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Response!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:16:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami! It's me, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ori... gami...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've gotta get back to Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fraxinus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you went all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.03,0:16:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pull back for now... is what I'd like to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:17:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't think we can\Nafford that in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our transport device is hanging in there,\Nso we'll send you over to Ori--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Long time no see, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi! What's your deal\Nat a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my, has the great Shido completely\Nforgotten what my goal actually is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At a time like this, you say?\NIn fact, what better time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let an opportunity \Nlike this slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi, please! Don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to save them!\NI have to save Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:18:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, but that's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody's voice is going\Nto reach Origami as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And by that I mean everyone, including you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What could she have possibly\Nseen on her trip over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.07,0:18:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, anyway... It's time\Nto do what I came to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time, Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get this started!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hopeless, no matter what you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Borrowing that phrase you people say...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.28,0:19:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let's begin our date!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cicadas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why isn't the city destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't this... Tengu City?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Tammie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, how is it that you know my nickname?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's me, Shido Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, are you trying to hit on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very sorry though.\NI have somewhere to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was Ms. Tammie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't find me. I'm in a different\Ntime than you are now, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Zaphkiel's last bullet, Yod Bet,\NI sent you to Tengu City five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five years ago?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take me back to where I belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--I don't have time for\Nyour screwing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Are you sure about that?\N--I don't have time for\Nyour screwing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The only way to reverse the\Ndisaster unfolding in the present...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is to deal with Origami over on that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're telling me Origami went\Nback five years to kill Phantom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:12.83,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Arai Shopping Arcade"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's exactly it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if that's true, why would Origami\Ngo Inverse in our original time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What in the world happened\Nto her when she came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is something even I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To find out exactly that, and to reverse it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,is why I shot you with Yod Bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, Kurumi... Why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Using your Angel for someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I had to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it's because I want proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Proof that history can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even becoming that which she hates,\Nher feet still trudge on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Crossing time, defying God...\NWhat lies at the end of her road?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:08.14,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:39.94,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Nine:\N'Tengu City, Five Years Ago'"
